WEBVTT

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:12.960
Nyuuu!

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.040
"CELL"
Come back here!

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.920
--Cell boy!
--Nyuuu!

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.380
Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.710
"WHITE BLOOD CELL"
Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:24.380
If he reaches an Immune Cell who can see
that he's good bacteria, he'll be fine.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.170
But if he gets dealt with
as a mere foreign substance,

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.210
then it would be out of my hands.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.380
Sorry.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.460
No way.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:38.080
That little guy... That little guy must've
given it all for this this body, too! I know it!

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.380
Why would you kill someone like that?

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:44.960
You Immune Cells are jerks!

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.460
That's...

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.460
That's my...

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.670
That's our...

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.290
It's our job, that's why.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.210
Long time no see.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:56.120
NK Cell!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:02.170
Here I am, taking my job seriously,

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:06.710
and knowingly or not,
you utter something I can't just ignore.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:09.580
Do you need to be schooled, perhaps?

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.620
If it wasn't for us Immune Cells,

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:16.330
the rest of you cells would be killed off
by the germs, all right?

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.420
And by the way, I'm an NK Cell.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:23.460
A Lymphocyte who can kill off
any cell at her own discretion.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:27.210
You need to watch your mouth, Cell boy.

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.540
Back off, NK!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.380
I don't believe you, either, Neutrophil!

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:34.040
What are you doing, acting all buddy-buddy?

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:37.750
I-I'm not acting buddy-buddy at all!

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:42.880
This person's beyond ferocious!
Are all Immune Cells like her?

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.960
Lactic Acid Bacterium, please just stay safe!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.330
"EPISODE 5:
CYTOKINES"

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.170
"EPISODE 5:
CYTOKINES"
"Cytokines."

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.000
"EPISODE 5:
CYTOKINES"

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.330
Nyuuu!

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.750
Nyuuu? Nyuuu?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.500
Hey, good morning! I see you're awake...

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.500
Nyuuu?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.670
...little Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:41.290
Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:47.080
I found you passed out
in the gutter outside, you know.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.210
Nyuuu?

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:52.000
I don't know what happened to you,
but you should rest up here for a bit.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.460
Want a cookie?

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.250
Nyuuu!

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.460
I'm Dendritic Cell. Nice to meet you.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:03.920
I just baked a big batch of these cookies.
You can take your time eating them, okay?

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.250
Nyuuu!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.500
Hey!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.420
Where are you?

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.120
Wait for me, Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.290
I'm coming to save you now!

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.250
Where are you?

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.170
Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.580
Dammit!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.710
I don't even have a clue!

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.080
What should I do?

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:38.250
I'm never going to find him, am I?

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.460
Oh my!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.620
Are you looking for something?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:47.210
Would you like us to help you find it?

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:57.000
Th-Th-Th-That won't be necessary!

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.580
Are you sure?

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:01.500
You seemed to be at a loss, so...

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.710
We're sorry we couldn't be of use to you.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.540
Good day!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.000
--Let's go! Let's go!
--Thank you for your hard work.

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:17.620
Hey! By the way, what are you two looking for?

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.830
Uh, nothing special, really.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.290
Oh?

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.750
You sure seem to be searching
pretty frantically to me.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.580
Hey! Where are you?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.750
Huh? Did you call?

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.880
Oh, pardon me.
Looks like you've got the wrong guy.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.580
Hey, Cell boy... Try not to be
conspicuous while NK's around!

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.170
But I have to find him as soon as possible!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:45.080
Never mind that, NK.
What were you doing there yourself?

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:48.290
Well, let's just say I was
looking for something, too.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.670
You, looking for something?

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:56.170
Uh, an influenza virus has been
detected near the small intestine.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.830
Beware of the risk
of being infected with influenza!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:03.290
"INFLUENZA VIRUS DETECTED
NEAR THE SMALL INTESTINE"
All Immune Cells in the area,
please head to the site immediately!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.210
Lightweights... At a time like this...

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.830
NK, what is it that you're looking for?

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.210
That red thing there!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:14.040
Found you, Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.290
Hold up! That's--

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.380
Kishaaa!

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:20.500
I-It's a virus-infected cell!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.830
The influenza virus.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:27.420
The virus responsible for
the infectious disease influenza.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:30.460
Falls into three main categories, A, B and C.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.290
Causes symptoms,
such as fevers over 100 degrees,

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:37.540
headaches, joint pain and muscle cramping.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.620
I don't have time to fool around
with you right now!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.330
What the...

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:55.420
I-It's so strong!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.670
Th-There's something really strange about them!

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.210
We came to help out!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.380
Eat this, damn virus!

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:21.880
Take this!

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.080
All right! That should do it!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.380
What the...

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.420
Memory Cell?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.120
My heart just--

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.120
Memory Cell, what's wrong?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.000
No good! It's the end of the world!

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.880
Everyone, run for your lives!
We were utterly powerless!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.460
Just as the stars will one day explode
and dissolve into the darkness of outer space--

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.040
In a nutshell!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.620
B Cell, we have no chance
against that influenza virus!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.750
Take a good look! Just look at him!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.880
Look at that virus's head!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.330
Those ominous points on his head!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.290
"POKE"
Those ominous points on his head!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.120
"POKE"
That's a different type of virus!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:06.960
That's a different type of virus!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.500
Antigenic shift in influenza.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:14.710
As influenza is prone to mutation,
the nature of the antigen changes every year.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:18.330
This is why it can't always be blocked
by acquired immunity.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.460
Our normal attacks aren't going to work on them!

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.120
Huh?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.250
For real?

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:29.040
This world is doomed!

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:37.120
"CELL
STILL MISSING"

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.620
"CELL
STILL MISSING"
Nyuuu...

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.500
"CELL
STILL MISSING"
Nyuuu!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.250
Lactic Acid Bacterium?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.080
Want some more cookies?

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.380
Nyuu... Nyuuu!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.290
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:52.290
And in return, if you don't mind...

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.960
...there's a favor I'd like to ask of you.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.500
Nyuuu?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:05.460
I-Influenza's something the body catches
now and then, right? Is it that scary?

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:06.670
Yeah.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.120
In its normal form,
we'd have a chance against it,

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:12.080
but it's a lot different if it's gone
through an antigenic shift!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:17.920
We don't have a single clue
about that one! Not a shred of data!

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:20.790
Even so, we can't just let them
have their way...

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.460
...or the virus-infected cells
could multiply like crazy!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.210
Hey! The spores are gathering!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:34.290
Oh crap! This is going to be
hit-or-miss, but here goes!

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.040
How do you like this?

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.620
No good! It's not working!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.000
Let's head into the tunnel for now!

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.580
White Blood Cell!

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:58.250
All right, now's your chance!
Make a run for it!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.920
O-Okay!

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.540
White Blood Cell!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.290
Outta my way, Ordinary Cell!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.790
I've got my hands full here!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.920
It dodged that?

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.290
In that case...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.670
These things...

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.710
I've never seen moves like that!

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:25.920
And they're crazy fast!

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:27.620
What's the problem, NK?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:32.580
Neutrophil and I kill infected cells, too,
but aren't you the pro among us?

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.580
They're dodging all of your attacks!

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:40.250
Sh-Shut up, will you?
I-I'm not losing to a mere influenza virus!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.620
N-NK?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.210
Wh-What the...

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.210
What the heck are they doing?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.920
The end is here!

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.920
Not good! They're heading this way!

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.000
Wh-What?

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.920
Are they bringing on a stomachache?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:08.330
"RUMBLE RUMBLE"

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.000
"CHURN CHURN"

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.290
"CHURN CHURN"
Wh-What?

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.170
"CHURN CHURN"
Are they bringing on a stomachache?

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.540
--Run!
--Or you'll get dragged into it!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.290
Nyuuu!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.540
--Nyuuu! Nyuuu!
--Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:22.040
Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.210
Lactic Acid--

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.580
Protect him with your life!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:29.960
White Blood Cell!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.000
Nyuuu!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.960
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.750
Thank you, White Blood Cell!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.290
"PLATELETS"

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.880
NK! You can't take them on
in close combat now!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.380
Distance yourself!

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:49.330
Damn... Why can't I...
kill those low-level scrubs?

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.420
I'm done.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:59.210
What's gotten into you, NK? You're the linchpin
of our virus-infected cell suppression strategy!

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:01.380
NK, don't tell me you're...

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.120
...weakened by stress!

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:04.790
Are you in a slump?

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:08.580
I'm a natural-born assassin, and yet...

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.000
Immunity and stress.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:16.920
Under stress, Lymphocyte activity
becomes sluggish and immunity plummets.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.500
Hey, NK, c'mon!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.710
Who am I anyway? Seriously, I've had enough.

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.710
NK! Snap out of it!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:25.620
I can't.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.580
Who's going to stop these guys, then?

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.380
When we met up earlier,

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:34.880
I was trying to stand up for you
because Cell boy was ranting at you.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.170
But you just got mad at me, Neutrophil!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.330
I-Is that right? M-My bad, NK! Thanks!

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:42.750
NK, don't ever lose confidence in yourself!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:46.170
We're pros! We've got skills
that we trained hard to master!

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:49.080
If we join forces,
we can beat any enemy!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.960
Get yourself motivated!
Get up! Get up and run!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.290
What's wrong? Are you motivated now--

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.170
N-NK, ma'am...

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:14.000
Whatever is the matter?

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:17.790
I'll kill anyone who saw it!
I'll kill anyone who saw it!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.290
Who the cell had the nerve to unearth this?

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.000
NK, are you activated now?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.620
How on earth?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:39.080
Hey, thanks a lot, Lactic Acid Bacterium.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.580
--Nyuuu?
--Thanks to all these
polysaccharides you produced.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:43.330
--Thanks to all these
polysaccharides you produced.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.580
Sorry.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.420
Nyu-nyuuu!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.460
For the first time in a long time...

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.710
...I've been activated!

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.710
How lactic acid bacteria works.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.420
Some lactic acid bacteria

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:11.880
produce polysaccharides
which modulate the immune system.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:19.290
These immunomodulatory polysaccharides are
said to assist in activating Dendritic Cells.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.080
Good day, everyone!

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:25.420
D-Dendritic Cell? Why are you dressed like that?

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:29.460
Hey, the stomachache's getting closer!
Let's get out of here!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.830
Everyone! Our enemy today...

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.540
...is unbelievably strong, right?

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:43.380
Therefore, I'll be glad to support you
from the shadows today!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.920
Kindly take a look at the photos
I've handed out!

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:53.580
Please gaze upon your past selves
and remember from whence you came!

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:58.120
"UNDERGOING ACTIVATION"

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:05.460
The truth is, I'd rather not do it this way.
You know, stoop to blackmail.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.460
Then, don't do it!

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:12.040
It's just that... You know,
it'll motivate you to try harder this way.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.380
The data doesn't lie!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.120
"CYTOKINES"
The data doesn't lie!

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:14.920
The data doesn't lie!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:17.620
So, let me be the first...

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:20.290
...to work even harder than usual, all right?

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.830
Cytokines.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:25.580
The blanket term for
physiologically active proteins

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:29.080
secreted by cells to stimulate other cells.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:32.420
H-Hold up a second, Dendritic Cell!
Don't go any farther--

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:35.790
We'll give it our all! We'll give it our all
for sure even without those!

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:39.460
I've already been activated! Give me a break!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:44.620
All right, everyone! Let's get cracking,
all bright-eyed and bushy-tailed now!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.620
Immunity boost.

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:51.040
When Dendritic Cells are activated,
they are thought to boost NK activation

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:57.290
and produce antibodies against certain viruses
through the production of cytokines.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.460
Nooooo!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.500
Oh my, how lovely.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:09.330
Everyone's going to have
a field day with these!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.620
Are you kidding me?

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:20.580
Wh-What's this? What's this?
What's this? What's this? What's this?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.750
B-B-Black History!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.750
Universe!

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.420
I'm on fire!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:38.580
Look how motivated everyone is!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.380
All right.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.420
Let's join in!

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:48.790
Wh-Wh-What the cell is this?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.790
N-No way is this me!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:54.920
Who the cell is this immature Thymocyte kid
who's a dead ringer for me?

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.040
"MOBILIZATION PERMIT"
"APPROVED"
Approved! Approved! Approved!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:02.080
Approved! Approved! Approved!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.790
I see.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:29.210
So, they were all able to fight like that
because you activated Dendritic Cell.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:32.920
That's right. Thanks to all
the polysaccharides he produced.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.580
Nyuuu!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:35.880
Lactic Acid Bacterium,

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:39.290
it's all thanks to you that they were able
to drive out the influenza virus.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.120
Nyuuu!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:43.380
--You're so tiny, and yet you're so amazing!
--Nyu-nyuuu!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.580
You're way better than me.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.790
I mean, look at me.
I dropped you in the waterway

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.290
and got blasted away by the stomachache.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:51.830
Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.000
--Sorry I put you in danger like that.
--Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.120
Nyuuu?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:58.170
It looks like someone will be
coming to pick you up.

00:17:58.170 --> 00:17:59.880
Oh, right.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.210
See? Here they are!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:10.580
Nyu-nyuuu!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.540
Your friends!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.420
Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.960
I didn't get to spend much time with you,

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.540
but this is goodbye.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.120
Nyuuu...

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.620
Take care of yourself, okay?

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.120
Nyu-nyuuu!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.580
Nyu-nyuuu!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.790
So, you're down to one now?

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:39.670
I'll take that one to his friends for you.

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:41.250
Oh...

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.920
Right.

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.670
Hey, White Blood Cell...

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:49.330
I'm sorry I called you a jerk
back at the waterway.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.540
I know I said some horrible things.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.250
Even though you were helping us out.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.920
When I got blasted away
by the stomachache,

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.250
I was so happy that you caught
the lactic acid bacterium.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:01.330
Thanks.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:06.000
No, I'm the one who should be
apologizing to you for scaring you,

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.460
for not notifying my friends,

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.750
for not being able to help you.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.750
Sorry.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:12.830
It's okay!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.330
Also... there's no need to think
you made me go along with you.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.120
After all, I actually enjoyed
myself a lot this time--

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:21.790
All right! I'm going to go
apologize to everyone!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:24.830
All you Immune Cells! Sorry, I had no idea!

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.210
Hold up, Cell boy!

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:30.750
Who knew you were being blackmailed
by embarrassing photos to make you work harder?

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.040
Especially you, NK--

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.080
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.250
Just let her be, all right?

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:39.830
A-Anyway, let me return
your last bacterium.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.170
Oh, okay.

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:44.620
Wait here for a second.
I'm going to go talk to NK.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.420
Remember, it's all over if they find that one.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.670
R-Right, I forgot!

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.790
I'll be right back!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.120
Okay!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.420
It's only you now, huh?

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:00.080
Nyuuu!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.540
Are you lonely?

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:04.120
It's going to be all right.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.330
I'll see to it that you're taken
to your friends, too.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.620
Nyuuu!

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:12.250
I'll kill that stupid leaf head!

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.620
No, that's not it!

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.580
Why am I so mentally weak?

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:17.710
NK!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.750
Do you have a minute?

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:23.170
"RELAXING TEA"
Uh, I'm just telling you
because it's all over now.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:27.210
It was that lactic acid bacterium
that we were searching for.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:30.330
We were keeping it hidden because
we wanted to return it to its friends.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.750
Oh really?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.790
I totally don't give a hoot.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.880
It must be fun to have such a peaceful life.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.580
Anyway, NK...

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:42.170
What was it that you were searching for?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:45.290
Oh, so that's where this is going?

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:49.330
Fine. It's not like it has nothing
to do with you, so I'll tell you.

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.580
Take this as a warning, too.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:54.880
Neutrophil, no matter who the enemy is,

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.960
it's in your best interest
not to think twice before killing it.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:05.120
You know that the data on all the cells we kill
is stored as antibody data, right?

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:10.040
And you also know that as long as they have
that data, cells can replicate, don't you?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.250
Yeah.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.210
A certain cell's antibody data has been leaked.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.080
What?

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:19.710
Along with the genetic data
included in those records.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:24.960
That cell's already acquired a physical form
somewhere inside this body.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.380
You remember, don't you?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:29.880
The one who swore to come
back to life and kill you...

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:35.330
And now I'm gonna die without
leaving my mark on this world!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:38.620
Why was I ever born in the first place?

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.750
That's who I'm searching for.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:54.290
Pretty sweet to have your own body!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.170
Now I can finally see you.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.960
At last.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.290
I can't wait.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:37.750
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.040
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"
You see, you see...

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:42.500
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"
They say there are germs called
"hard candy bacteria" in the large intestine!

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:45.580
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"
Wait, I think you mean
"harmful bacteria," right?

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:47.170
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"
Next episode of <i>Cells at Work!!</i>,
"Harmful Bacteria."

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:48.960
"EPISODE 6:
HARMFUL BACTERIA"
Next episode of <i>Cells at Work!!</i>,
"Harmful Bacteria."

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:51.960
"EPISODE 6:
HARMFUL BACTERIA"
Work hard every day!
